# PWA & Notifications

## Three Runtime Environments

```
getRuntime() → "electron" | "pwa" | "browser"
```

| Runtime | Router | Notifications | Service Worker | Install |
|---------|--------|---------------|----------------|---------|
| `electron` | HashRouter | IPC → main process | NONE (disabled) | — |
| `pwa` | BrowserRouter | Web Notifications API | Workbox (auto) | Installed |
| `browser` | BrowserRouter | Web Notifications API | Workbox (auto) | Prompt available |

## Runtime Detection

```typescript
import { isElectron } from "~/shared/lib/electron";
import { isPwa, getRuntime } from "~/shared/lib/pwa";

if (isElectron()) { /* Electron desktop */ }
if (isPwa()) { /* PWA standalone mode */ }
```

## Notifications — Unified API

```typescript
import { notificationService } from "~/shared/lib/notifications";

// Request permission (once)
await notificationService.requestPermission();

// Show notification (any runtime)
await notificationService.show({
  title: "New message",
  body: "Hello!",
  tag: "msg-12345",        // deduplication
  onClick: () => navigate("/dm/42"),
});

// Badge count (PWA only, via navigator.setAppBadge)
await notificationService.setBadgeCount(5);
await notificationService.clearBadge();
```

## PWA Install Prompt

```typescript
import { canInstallPwa, promptInstallPwa, onInstallAvailableChange } from "~/shared/lib/pwa";

// Check availability
if (canInstallPwa()) {
  const outcome = await promptInstallPwa(); // "accepted" | "dismissed"
}

// Subscribe to availability changes
const unsub = onInstallAvailableChange(() => {
  // update UI (show/hide "Install" button)
});
```

## Service Worker

- vite-plugin-pwa generates SW automatically on `npm run build`
- registerType: `"prompt"` — user decides when to update
- Caching: static assets (CacheFirst) + API responses (NetworkFirst, 5 min)
- User uploads: CacheFirst (30 days, 200 entries)
- SW is NOT registered in Electron (ELECTRON=1 disables the plugin)

## Electron vs PWA: Feature Comparison

| Feature | Electron | PWA/Browser |
|---------|----------|-------------|
| Native notifications | ipcRenderer → main | Web Notifications API |
| App badge | Main process | navigator.setAppBadge |
| Offline | Not needed (desktop) | Workbox service worker |
| Install | installer (NSIS/DMG) | beforeinstallprompt |
| Auto-update | electron-updater | SW update prompt |
| Deep links | Electron protocol handler | Web URL |
| File system | Main process IPC | Download API |
